<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="sub">Last updated: 2026-07-23</p>

<h2>Overview</h2>
<p>Chamonix Events is a community events calendar for the Chamonix valley. We take your privacy seriously. This policy explains what information we collect, why we collect it, and how we use it.</p>

<h2>Information We Collect</h2>

<h3>Event Submissions</h3>
<p>When you submit an event via our <a href="/submit.html">submission form</a>, we collect:</p>
<ul>
<li>Your name (optional — for attribution purposes)</li>
<li>Your email address (optional — for follow-up questions about your submission)</li>
<li>Event details you provide (title, date, description, venue, etc.)</li>
</ul>
<p>This information is stored in our database and may appear publicly on the site if the event is approved. Your email address is <strong>never</strong> published or shared.</p>

<h3>Automatically Collected Data</h3>
<p>We do <strong>not</strong> set cookies, use tracking scripts, or collect personal data through analytics. The site has no user accounts, no login system, and no tracking pixels.</p>

<h3>Third-Party Services</h3>
<p>The site uses the following external services:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> — for typography (Inter and Playfair Display fonts). Google may collect your IP address when loading fonts. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
<li><strong>Leaflet.js</strong> with OpenStreetMap tiles — for venue maps. Map tiles are loaded from OpenStreetMap's CDN. See <a href="https://wiki.osmfoundation.org/wiki/Privacy_Policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenStreetMap Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
<li><strong>TMDB</strong> (The Movie Database) — for cinema poster images. See <a href="https://www.themoviedb.org/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TMDB Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
<li><strong>AlloCiné</strong> — for cinema showtime data. See <a href="https://www.allocine.fr/conditions/confidentialite.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AlloCiné Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Data Storage and Retention</h2>
<p>Event data is stored in a SQLite database on our server. Review queue records are retained indefinitely for operational purposes. If you submitted an event and want it removed, <a href="/about.html">contact us</a>.</p>

<h2>Your Rights</h2>
<p>Under GDPR (if you are in the EU/EEA) and applicable privacy laws, you have the right to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Request access to any personal data we hold about you</li>
<li>Request correction or deletion of your data</li>
<li>Object to processing of your data</li>
<li>Request data portability</li>
</ul>
<p>To exercise these rights, please contact us via the details on the <a href="/about.html">About page</a>.</p>

<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>

<p class="updated">Chamonix Events · A community events calendar for the Chamonix valley. No user accounts, no tracking, no cookies.</p>
